<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-4983] Packages defined at the interpreter do not work in K8s setup</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-4983</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I tried the &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.delta.io/latest/quick-start.html#set-up-apache-spark-with-delta-lake&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;delta extension&lt;/a&gt; in my K8s setup.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seems that packages are not sync to a remote interpreter. How is this solved in other setups?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zjffdu&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;zjffdu&quot;&gt;zjffdu&lt;/a&gt; How you solve this in YARN-Cluster`&lt;br/&gt;
 EDIT: Found YARN solution - &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/e94d439604209545224270b871c5979772457535/zeppelin-plugins/launcher/yarn/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/interpreter/launcher/YarnRemoteInterpreterProcess.java#L438-L443&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Creating a ZIP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=moon&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;moon&quot;&gt;moon&lt;/a&gt; Do you have an idea to solve this problem in the K8s setup?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;ins&gt;Possible Solutions:&lt;/ins&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&apos;table-wrap&apos;&gt;
&lt;table class=&apos;confluenceTable&apos;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&apos;confluenceTh&apos;&gt;Solution&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&apos;confluenceTh&apos;&gt;Pro&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&apos;confluenceTh&apos;&gt;Con&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;Zeppelin Sync&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(Should) work out of the box&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;needs new implementation, which is quite complex, because we must sync the content before startup
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/e94d439604209545224270b871c5979772457535/bin/interpreter.sh#L273&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Line, which loads local-repository into classpath&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;may affect other interpreters launcher&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Dependencies are synchronized each time a new interpreter pod is created&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/persistent-volumes/#access-modes&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;K8s ReadWriteMany Storage&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br/&gt;
 (e.g. NFS, GlusterFS, AzureFS)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Zeppelin independent&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Dependencies are only download once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;needs more complex K8s configuration&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;needs a ReadWriteMany Storage&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;doesn&apos;t work out of box&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Best Regards&lt;br/&gt;
 Philipp&lt;/p&gt;</description>
